SUMMARY:Beginner Mosaic Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa Creative Circle\n**In this 4-hour workshop you will
 :**\n\n* **Learn the proper tools and supplies to create your mosaic piece
 .**\n* **Learn how to cut and place tiles to create your piece so it reads
  properly.**\n* **Learn to grout and seal your piece.**\n\n**Bring your ow
 n design ideas or choose one from the MANY templates at The Arthaus. You c
 an choose to hang your mosaic outdoors OR indoors. If you choose indoors\,
  you will leave with a framed 10x10 inch piece.**\n\n**See additional samp
 le photos below. Visit www.arthausonbarnes.com for workshop reviews from p
 revious mosaic students.**\n\n**First time at The Arthaus? No need to feel
  shy\, I promise you will feel right at home within minutes!**\n\n**Paymen
 t is due in advance via Venmo. 925-548-8077 (text with questions).**\n\n**
 Venmo:**\n**$85.00**\n**@Elizabeth-Monaghan-12**
